9
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:54,000
Avengers: Doomsday and Avengers: Secret Wars are American superhero films based on the Marvel Comics superhero team the
Avengers, produced by Marvel Studios and AGBO, and distributed by Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures.

10
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:06,000
They are respectively the fifth and sixth installments in the Avengers film series following Avengers:
Endgame (2019), and the 39th and 40th films of the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU).

11
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Both films are directed by Anthony and Joe Russo from
screenplays by Michael Waldron and Stephen McFeely.

12
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:30,000
They feature an ensemble cast composed of many previous MCU actors, headlined by Vanessa Kirby, Anthony Mackie,
Letitia Wright, Ebon Moss-Bachrach, Simu Liu, Joseph Quinn, Pedro Pascal, and Robert Downey Jr.

13
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:42,000
In Doomsday, the Avengers, Wakandans, Fantastic Four, New Avengers,
and the X-Men team up to face Doctor Doom (Downey).

14
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:54,000
Two new Avengers films, The Kang Dynasty and Secret Wars, were announced in July 2022
as the conclusion of the MCU's Phase Six and "The Multiverse Saga".

15
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:06,000
Destin Daniel Cretton was hired to direct The Kang Dynasty and Jonathan Majors
was set to reprise his MCU role as the villain Kang the Conqueror.

16
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:18,000
Jeff Loveness was hired to write The Kang Dynasty that September and
Waldron was hired to write Secret Wars a month later.

17
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:30,000
In November 2023, Cretton departed, Waldron replaced Loveness as writer of The Kang Dynasty as well, and Marvel was considering
moving away from the Kang storyline in part due to Majors's legal issues; Majors was fired the following month.

18
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:42,000
The return of the Russo brothers as directors and McFeely as co-writer, the casting of Downey as new villain
Doctor Doom, and the new subtitle Doomsday for the first film were all announced in July 2024.

19
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:54,000
Both films are being produced at Pinewood Studios in England.

20
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:06,000
Filming for Doomsday took place from April to September 2025, and
filming for Secret Wars is scheduled to begin in mid-2026.

21
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:18,000
Jeffrey Ford is editing the films and Alan Silvestri is composing the
musical score for them, both returning from previous MCU films.

22
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:30,000
Avengers: Doomsday is scheduled for release on December 18, 2026, and Avengers: Secret Wars is
scheduled for release on December 17, 2027, both part of Phase Six of the MCU.

23
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:42,000
The film explores themes of superhero, based on comic, sequel,
superhero team, marvel cinematic universe (mcu).

24
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:54,000
The tone is thought_provoking.
